{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07666","headline":"临风舒锦 · 萧昕","name":"临风舒锦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽锦疋云终，襜襜展向风。\n花开翻覆翠，色乱动摇红。\n缕散悠扬里，文回照灼中。\n低垂疑步障，吹起作晴虹。\n既与丘迟梦，深知卓氏功。\n还乡将制服，从此表亨通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧昕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}